Task 4: Implementing Organization and Location-Based Permissions
Subtask 4.1: Configure Organization-Specific Access
Create Department-Specific Roles

Create Development Team role:

Name: Development Team
Description: Access to development resources only

Permissions:
- view_hosts (filtered to Development hostgroup)
- view_content_views (filtered to Dev content views)
