Common Troubleshooting Issues
Issue 1: User Cannot Access Expected Resources
Symptoms: User receives "Access Denied" errors for resources they should access

Solution:

# Check user role assignments
hammer user info --login username

# Verify organization/location context
# Ensure user is assigned to correct org/location

# Check role permissions
hammer role info --name "Role Name"
Issue 2: Permissions Not Working as Expected
Symptoms: User has more or less access than intended

Solution:

# Review all assigned roles
# Check for conflicting permissions
# Verify filter configurations
# Test in different contexts
Issue 3: Role Assignment Fails
Symptoms: Cannot assign role to user or organization

Solution:

# Verify role exists and is active
# Check organization/location assignments
# Ensure proper administrative permissions
# Review audit logs for errors
