Why This Matters: RBAC is crucial for enterprise environments because it:

Enhances Security: Limits access to only necessary resources, reducing security risks
Improves Compliance: Helps meet regulatory requirements for access control and auditing
Increases Efficiency: Users can focus on their specific responsibilities without unnecessary complexity
Enables Delegation: Allows distributed administration while maintaining security boundaries
Supports Scalability: Provides a framework for managing access as organizations grow
